        ],
        "text": "Theodore B. Olson argues that the per\u2011se illegality rule for resale\u2011price maintenance is outdated and should be replaced with the rule\u2011of\u2011reason standard applied to other vertically imposed marketing restrictions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Coykendall",
